# Release binaries live in a GitHub Release asset

This directory is intentionally kept (almost) empty in git.
Its contents are published as a single archive in the GitHub Release.
See `assets.yaml` at the repository root: it lists every archive's download URL
and sha256.

Fastest way to restore it: run `python fetch_assets.py` at the repository root —
it downloads every archive, verifies sha256, and extracts it here for you.
